<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Nouvelle inscription · WikiFormation</title>
  <style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px){.mail-padding{padding:28px 22px!important}.mail-title{font-size:28px!important}.mail-shell{padding:16px 8px!important}}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#eef2f6;color:#203747;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">{{ adherent.prenom }} {{ adherent.nom }} vient de créer un compte sur WikiFormation.</div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background:#eef2f6;"><tr><td class="mail-shell" align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">
    <!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="600" align="center"><tr><td><![endif]-->
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dce5ed;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;">
      <tr><td class="mail-padding" style="padding:38px 40px;background:#142b3b;border-top:4px solid #d8b76b;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 32px;color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;">Wiki<span style="color:#e7c780;">Formation</span></p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#e7c780;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;">VIE DE LA PLATEFORME</p>
        <h1 class="mail-title" style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:34px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:normal;">Une nouvelle inscription.</h1>
        <p style="margin:16px 0 0;color:#cbd7e0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">Un nouvel utilisateur rejoint WikiFormation.</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td class="mail-padding" style="padding:36px 40px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">Bonjour,<br>Voici les informations du compte qui vient d’être créé sur la plateforme.</p>
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background:#f5f8fa;border:1px solid #dce5ed;border-radius:12px;">
          <tr><td style="padding:24px;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#627586;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;">NOUVEAU COMPTE</p>
            <p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:23px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:bold;overflow-wrap:anywhere;">{{ adherent.prenom }} {{ adherent.nom }}</p>
            <p style="margin:0 0 5px;color:#627586;font-size:12px;">Adresse e-mail</p>
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;word-break:break-all;"><a href="mailto:{{ adherent.email }}" style="color:#203747;text-decoration:underline;">{{ adherent.email }}</a></p>
          </td></tr>
        </table>
        <p style="margin:24px 0;color:#627586;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;">Cette notification signale la création du compte. Elle ne confirme pas encore la validation de l’adresse e-mail.</p>
        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#e7c780" style="border-radius:9px;text-align:center;mso-padding-alt:16px 24px;"><a href="https://wikiformation.fr" style="display:inline-block;padding:16px 24px;color:#142b3b;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #e7c780;border-radius:9px;">Accéder à la plateforme &rarr;</a></td></tr></table>
        <p style="margin:28px 0 0;color:#627586;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;">L’équipe WikiFormation</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:24px;background:#f8fafc;border-top:1px solid #e4ebf0;text-align:center;color:#627586;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;">Notification administrative · WikiFormation<br><a href="https://wikiformation.fr" style="color:#203747;text-decoration:none;">wikiformation.fr</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; © {{ 'now'|date('Y') }}</td></tr>
    </table>
    <!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
  </td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
